Note on data source:

The wine bottle and varietal data in cellar-keeper-data.json / cellar-keeper-data.js
is derived from the Steam Community guide "Cellar Keeper Cellar 1 Alphabetical
Shelf-by-Shelf Guide" by SteffRenn
(https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3779159708).

The wine bottle SVG icon is from SVG Repo
(https://www.svgrepo.com/svg/326735/wine-bottle) and is free for commercial use.

This project is an unofficial fan-made companion and is not affiliated with
EgoTrampoline or Valve. Cellar Keeper and all related assets belong to their
respective owners.
